[gd_scene load_steps=12 format=3]

; Six-chamber revolver, matched to grenade_launcher_model.tscn: olive body,
; near-black barrel and furniture, steel working parts. NO EMISSIVE — the
; amber pip on the first pass read as a repair light, and nothing on a gun in
; this game glows.
;
; Distinct from the Ancient Grenade Launcher by silhouette alone: that one is a
; square box with a stubby tube, this is a drum you can see the rounds in.

